# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card tp4/next-2 window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/next-2 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here
# names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The window's jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed
# from this branch.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG names the image N0 builds from this same commit; a later commit needs a new tag.
# C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-2 is a PLACEHOLDER: the driver of the window may substitute it (in every template) once the image is built
# from the pushed branch; the driver's IMAGE_TAG env overrides it.
# R1c (third of the five R1 runs, see R1): the audits-off hang shapes on c2-packed-tp4-diag-rshard: the DIAG twin (the old tail, QWEN_FAST_BUDGET_CAP=0; both verify audits OFF; the hang
# instruments, the stall watch at 120 s with its triage and the handle guard in log mode are c2-packed-tp4-diag's) plus
# QWEN_FAST_REQUEST_SHARD_ARGMAX=1. The tests are the hang shapes in the order the smoke runs them: the engine build after many packed
# rounds (concurrent4_steady, replay_concurrent4) and the four-user tail (concurrent4, concurrent4_v164order).
# The lever (QWEN_FAST_REQUEST_SHARD_ARGMAX=1, verifier_engine_tp.py): the request engine's rows=1/2/4 verify traces pick tokens with the
# packed block's per-chip shard argmax (an argmax and a max on each chip's own vocab shard, combined on the host) instead of the pinned
# sampler, so those traces bake no sampler AllGather, untilize or ArgMax. Hypothesis: the audits-off hang (the first replay of a request's
# rows=2 verify trace after many packed rounds) needs the pinned sampler's AllGather in that trace.
# Read: '[PINDIAG] request shard argmax engaged rows=1 audit=0', rows=2 and rows=4 (one line each) and NO '[PINDIAG] request shard argmax
# kept the pinned sampler' line; a stall (the stall watch dumps every thread, runs the triage tools, then ends the process) is the
# finding that the pinned sampler was not the hazard. Tokens: the served path is the same ids, so every concurrent4 hash must equal the
# diag arms'. Five consecutive runs, each after its own card reset, that all complete are the evidence: R1, R1b, R1c, R1d and R1e are the five (one
# template each, each resetting the cards first); one stall restarts the count, and R0/R3 run only after all five completed. Ids: R1 serves
# the shard argmax's ids UNAUDITED; R2b is the audited twin of this arm and runs before R1.
# OPTIONAL: its product is data. Duration (estimate): 20 min.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-2
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-diag-rshard
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,long_real_text,concurrent4,concurrent4_v164order,concurrent4_steady,replay_concurrent4
